# Bounce sshd for the Proton VPN exit — ported from projects/vpn_bounce
# (load/sshd_config). Shares the container's netns with the Proton tunnel, so an
# `ssh -W %h:%p` / `ProxyJump` through it egresses via Proton. Forwarding is the
# whole job; AllowTcpForwarding is the load-bearing line. Key-only: the sole
# authorized key is the bounce keypair the vpn service injects (see ssh_server).
AuthorizedKeysFile	.ssh/authorized_keys

PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no

AllowTcpForwarding yes
GatewayPorts no
X11Forwarding no

Subsystem	sftp	internal-sftp
